            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for to scan, then the Kannada for a pilot."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ತೂಗು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೂಗು — tūgu — \"to weigh; to swing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಿಬ್ಬಂದಿ ನನ್ನ ಸೂಟ್ಕೇಸನ್ನು ತೂಗಿದರು. sibbandi nanna sūṭkēsannu tūgidaru. The staff weighed my suitcase."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ತೂಗಿದೆ, tūgide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun beside it is ತೂಕ, weight; ತೊಟ್ಟಿಲು ತೂಗು (tūgu) is to rock a cradle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೂಗು (tūgu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3376 lists Kannada tūgu, tūṅku, \"to weigh, to swing, to rock a cradle\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
